of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AdyJH8kDm8xT8IKTlgpEC15ny4u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":566525,\"title\":\"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22,\"title\":\"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":931285,\"title\":\"Mortal Kombat II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hwRdDFIhaEmpRgoki805YvyyjZf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4EAAwpylq313qrDqpCxulUrXBNF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The fan favorite champions—now joined by Johnny Cage himself—are pitted against one another in the ultimate, no-holds barred, gory battle to defeat the dark rule of Shao Kahn that threatens the very existence of the Earthrealm and its defenders.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460555,\"title\":\"Operation Red Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ctXBO0o5fKQvGdSJsPc8TAYCvp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zYWgVYAI7elv6lpnXCyUtIkSOpM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A squad of the Jiaolong Commando Unit - Sea Dragon, a spec ops team of the Chinese Navy, carries out a hostage rescue operation in the nation of Yewaire, on the Arabian Peninsula, and fiercely fights against local rebel groups and Zaka, a terrorist organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1271,\"title\":\"300\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7Lcio0c9ohxPhSZg42eTlKIVVY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgBZlJ1LHQel5nneNQMoesmvc7l.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A story very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9703,\"title\":\"The Last Legion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2jaEoOsTEMqSskBJm3gfcuxNEc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tgaMo8q1HpGTbtpmJm8TYKTpOr4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As the Roman empire crumbles, young Romulus Augustus flees the city and embarks on a perilous voyage to Britain to track down a legion of supporters.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2486,\"title\":\"Eragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mNu6QLUnKqPIjRA3pgEb5dkJye6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2GB3sdsWn3drlkwGMMNQ3KFNbIV.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In his homeland of Alagaesia, a farm boy happens upon a dragon's egg -- a discovery that leads him on a predestined journey where he realized he's the one person who can defend his home against an evil king.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"AyIZ9tiiN8I\",\"name\":\"Official Countdown Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"f_bKjZeJBBI\",\"name\":\"Official New Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Mzw2ttJD2qQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}